<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring bids mostly lower.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring bids mostly lower.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spring wheat cash basis bids were mostly lower on Thursday in very quiet dealings, merchandisers and brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;A few cars keep showing up everyday but that is about it,&quot; a Minneapolis dealer said.</p>
<p>&quot;If there is any kind of demand at all it seems to be for 15 percent protein spring wheat. The mills seem to have a little bit of a need for nearbys,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>There is not a lot of rail traffic in Montana. Business is extremely slow, another dealer said.</p>
<p>MGE December spring wheat futures lost 2-3/4 cents at $4.20 a bushel.</p>
